sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Recruiter
    participant G as LangGraph agent
    participant H as MCPHub
    participant FS as filesystem server
    participant RS as resume_search server
    participant DB as candidate_db server

    Note over H,DB: startup: initialize + tools/list on each server
    R->>G: jobs/senior_python_backend.txt
    G->>H: parse_jd
    H->>FS: tools/call read_file
    FS-->>H: job text
    G->>H: search_resumes (round 1)
    H->>RS: tools/call rank_resumes
    RS-->>H: 100 scored resumes
    G->>H: rank_candidates (round 2)
    H->>FS: tools/call batch_process(read, 10 paths)
    FS-->>H: progress 1..10, then texts
    H->>FS: tools/call batch_process(search, skills)
    G->>H: generate_report (round 3)
    H->>FS: tools/call write_file reports/...md
    H->>DB: tools/call save_shortlist
    G-->>R: report, then interrupt() waits
    R->>G: Watch for new resumes
    G->>H: watch_resumes
    H->>FS: tools/call watch_directory
    Note over FS: a new resume lands in resumes/
    FS-->>H: created event + resources/list_changed
    H->>FS: tools/call batch_process(read, new file)
    H->>RS: tools/call upsert_resumes
    G->>H: re-run rounds 1-3
    G-->>R: new candidate ranked, changes explained
    R->>G: Have we shortlisted Ravi before?
    G->>H: agent tool call
    H->>DB: tools/call get_candidate_history
    DB-->>H: past shortlists and decisions
    G-->>R: grounded answer
